@lang en
IMPORT `pti268-decision`

-- Tests of whole claims: every general exclusion (one fact that triggers it and, where the
-- text carves one out, the near miss that does not), and scenarios that run the layers
-- together: cover, then the sub-limits, then the limit, then the time limits.
-- The schedule figures are the fixtures' scenario values (limits of Benefit 2 20.000.000,
-- Benefit 4 40.000.000 with surgery 20.000.000, Benefit 6 10.000.000, room VND 1.000.000 a
-- day, allowance VND 200.000 a day, 60 days). Every expected amount is worked beside it.

§ `Tests — whole claims`

§§ `Part IV — every general exclusion`

GIVEN c IS A `A circumstance`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`an accident claim with` c MEANS
    `the employee's claim for` (`an accident on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `with` (LIST c)) `on` `Benefit 2`
        `for` (`medical expenses` (`an outpatient visit on` (YMD 2026 6 1)) EMPTY) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1)

GIVEN c IS A `A circumstance`
GIVETH A MAYBE `A general exclusion`
`what is engaged by` c MEANS
    `the general exclusion engaged by` c `in` (`an accident claim with` c)

