§§ `Scenario 1 — Benefit 2, an accident and a hospital stay`

-- An accident on 1 March 2026; three nights in hospital (1 to 4 March). Surgery 5.000.000;
-- room 3 days 3.600.000, cut to 3 x 1.000.000 = 3.000.000 (def 16); a porcelain crown of
-- ordinary material 3.000.000, cut to 10% of 20.000.000 = 2.000.000; medicine 1.000.000; a
-- crown of precious material 2.000.000, not paid; a consultation in the stay 200.000 (def 15).
-- Total 5 + 3 + 2 + 1 + 0 + 0,2 = 11.200.000.
GIVETH A `A course of treatment`
`the accident stay` MEANS `an inpatient stay from` (YMD 2026 3 1) `to` (YMD 2026 3 4)

GIVETH A LIST OF `An item of expense`
`the accident items` MEANS
    LIST `an item of` `surgery` `for` 5000000 `on` (YMD 2026 3 1),
         `an item of` (`room and board` 3) `for` 3600000 `on` (YMD 2026 3 4),
         `an item of` `dental crowns or false teeth of ordinary material` `for` 3000000 `on` (YMD 2026 3 2),
         `an item of` `medicine` `for` 1000000 `on` (YMD 2026 3 2),
         `an item of` `dental crowns or false teeth of precious material` `for` 2000000 `on` (YMD 2026 3 2),
         `an item of` `a consultation` `for` 200000 `on` (YMD 2026 3 2)

GIVEN paid  IS A NUMBER
      other IS A MAYBE `Other insurance`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the accident claim with` paid `paid before and` other MEANS
    `a claim built from` `the plain contract` `the employee` (`an accident on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `with` EMPTY) `Benefit 2`
        (`medical expenses` `the accident stay` `the accident items`) (YMD 2026 3 1)
        paid other FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1)) NOTHING FALSE (`a file submitted on` (YMD 2026 3 10))

#ASSERT `the claim is covered` (`the accident claim with` 0 `paid before and` NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the medical costs Benefit 2 allows in` (`the accident claim with` 0 `paid before and` NOTHING) EQUALS 11200000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the accident claim with` 0 `paid before and` NOTHING) EQUALS 11200000
-- With 15.000.000 already paid this period, 5.000.000 of the 20.000.000 remains.
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the accident claim with` 15000000 `paid before and` NOTHING) EQUALS 5000000
-- With other insurance paying 6.000.000, limits totalling 40.000.000: the excess is
-- 5.200.000, the proportion 11.200.000 x 20/40 = 5.600.000; the larger (fork F20).
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the accident claim with` 0 `paid before and` (JUST (`Other insurance` OF 6000000, 40000000))) EQUALS 5600000
#ASSERT `the amount PTI must pay on` (`the accident claim with` 0 `paid before and` NOTHING) EQUALS 11200000

§§ `Scenario 2 — Benefit 4, an illness, surgery and procedures`

-- An illness from 1 March 2026; in hospital 1 to 6 April (five nights). Surgery 15.000.000;
-- a therapeutic procedure 12.000.000, cut to 50% of the 20.000.000 surgery limit =
-- 10.000.000, and the surgery costs together cut to 20.000.000; room 5 days 7.500.000, cut
-- to 5.000.000; tests 2.000.000; tests on 15 March (17 days before admission) 1.000.000,
-- paid; treatment on 25 May (49 days after discharge) 500.000, not paid.
-- Total 20 + 5 + 2 + 1 = 28.000.000, within the 40.000.000 limit.
GIVEN paid IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the surgery claim, with already paid` paid MEANS
    `a claim built from` `the plain contract` `the employee` (`an illness from` (YMD 2026 3 1) `diagnosed as` `another illness or injury` `with` EMPTY) `Benefit 4`
        (`medical expenses` (`an inpatient stay from` (YMD 2026 4 1) `to` (YMD 2026 4 6))
            (LIST `an item of` `surgery` `for` 15000000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 2),
                  `an item of` `a therapeutic procedure` `for` 12000000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 3),
                  `an item of` (`room and board` 5) `for` 7500000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 6),
                  `an item of` `tests, ultrasound, X-ray and CT scans` `for` 2000000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 1),
                  `an item of` `tests in the 30 days before admission` `for` 1000000 `on` (YMD 2026 3 15),
                  `an item of` `treatment in the 45 days after discharge` `for` 500000 `on` (YMD 2026 5 25)))
        (YMD 2026 4 1) paid NOTHING FALSE (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1)) NOTHING FALSE (`a file submitted on` (YMD 2026 6 1))

#ASSERT `the claim is covered` (`the surgery claim, with already paid` 0)
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the surgery claim, with already paid` 0) EQUALS 28000000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`the surgery claim, with already paid` 30000000) EQUALS 10000000

