§§ `Scenario 6 — maternity under III.8`

-- Childbirth on 15 April 2026 (104 days from 1 January), two nights: room 2.000.000,
-- medicine 1.000.000, surgery 4.000.000, so 7.000.000. In a contract of more than 50
-- employees it is paid in the proportion 105/210, so 3.500.000; with 50 employees the 210-day
-- wait bars it.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a childbirth claim under a contract with employees numbering` n MEANS
    `a claim under` (`a 2026 contract for` n `employees and` n `persons with` EMPTY) `by` (`a new member` `a spouse` `born on` (YMD 1995 1 1))
        `for` (`an event of kind` `childbirth` `on` (YMD 2026 4 15)) `on` `Benefit 4`
        `for` (`medical expenses` (`an inpatient stay from` (YMD 2026 4 15) `to` (YMD 2026 4 17))
                  (LIST `an item of` (`room and board` 2) `for` 2000000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 17),
                        `an item of` `medicine` `for` 1000000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 16),
                        `an item of` `surgery` `for` 4000000 `on` (YMD 2026 4 15)))
        `on` (YMD 2026 4 15)

#ASSERT `the share paid under the maternity proviso in` (`a childbirth claim under a contract with employees numbering` 51) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a childbirth claim under a contract with employees numbering` 51) EQUALS 3500000
#ASSERT `the amount payable on` (`a childbirth claim under a contract with employees numbering` 50) EQUALS 0

